you accepted it in secret, I'm sure.

312
00:23:44,090 --> 00:23:47,390
But Kathleen does not seem like an ordinary
woman. She might be an assassin.

313
00:23:47,390 --> 00:23:48,320
No way!

314
00:23:48,320 --> 00:23:51,190
